{
  "project_id": 21,
  "project_label": "gemma",
  "task_id": 9591,
  "title": "Math can help uncover cancer's secrets",
  "author": "Irina Kareva",
  "url": "https://www.ted.com/talks/irina_kareva_math_can_help_uncover_cancer_s_secrets",
  "annotation_id": null,
  "completed_by": 7,
  "created_at": "2026-05-07T05:00:56.970865Z",
  "updated_at": "2026-05-07T05:00:56.970865Z",
  "lead_time": 41.928,
  "result": [
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "0",
        "end": "0",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 18,
        "text": "I am a translator.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "954BB7F0DE",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "1",
        "end": "1",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 57,
        "text": "I translate from biology into mathematics and vice versa.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "D153A8BB61",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "2",
        "end": "2",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 141,
        "text": "I write mathematical models which, in my case, are systems of differential equations, to describe biological mechanisms, such as cell growth.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "C31B33E578",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "3",
        "end": "3",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 32,
        "text": "Essentially, it works like this.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "9D99912649",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "4",
        "end": "4",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 110,
        "text": "First, I identify the key elements that I believe may be driving behavior over time of a particular mechanism.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "79140FC05C",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "5",
        "end": "5",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 107,
        "text": "Then, I formulate assumptions about how these elements interact with each other and with their environment.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "26F4D6C969",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "6",
        "end": "6",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 32,
        "text": "It may look something like this.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "0094FA38F5",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "7",
        "end": "7",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 87,
        "text": "Then, I translate these assumptions into equations, which may look something like this.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "0BFE81FE7E",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "8",
        "end": "8",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 92,
        "text": "Finally, I analyze my equations and translate the results back into the language of biology.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "EA609B96D3",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "9",
        "end": "9",
        "startOffset": 46,
        "endOffset": 127,
        "text": "we, as modelers, do not think about what things are; we think about what they do.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "75498254C8",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "9",
        "end": "9",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 127,
        "text": "we think about what things are; we think about what they do.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "REP"
        ]
      },
      "id": "2BE623219F",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "10",
        "end": "10",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 157,
        "text": "We think about relationships between individuals, whether they be cells, animals or people, and how they interact with each other and with their environment.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "AA464274D0",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "11",
        "end": "11",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 27,
        "text": "Let me give you an example.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "694D7A5753",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "12",
        "end": "12",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 46,
        "text": "What do foxes and immune cells have in common?",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "DBD7EB8A01",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "13",
        "end": "13",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 22,
        "text": "They're both predators",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "0D541B3C5A",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "14",
        "end": "14",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 180,
        "text": "But from a mathematical point of view, a qualitatively same system of predator-prey type equations will describe interactions between foxes and rabbits and cancer and immune cells.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "220757F40C",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "15",
        "end": "15",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 26,
        "text": "predator-prey type systems",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "2F0D405F92",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "15",
        "end": "15",
        "startOffset": 160,
        "endOffset": 179,
        "text": "consuming the other",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "8949B49E84",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "16",
        "end": "16",
        "startOffset": 97,
        "endOffset": 154,
        "text": "cancer is the prey, and the immune system is the predator",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "FD42A2C6A8",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "17",
        "end": "17",
        "startOffset": 95,
        "endOffset": 114,
        "text": "camouflaging itself",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "3638EB9ADE",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "17",
        "end": "17",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 147,
        "text": "stealing the predator’s food",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "9A4BF84702",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "18",
        "end": "18",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 49,
        "text": "This can have some very interesting implications.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "33E4B457DC",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "19",
        "end": "19",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 144,
        "text": "For example, despite enormous successes in the field of immunotherapy, there still remains somewhat limited efficacy when it comes solid tumors.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "394B7D7895",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "20",
        "end": "20",
        "startOffset": 4,
        "endOffset": 38,
        "text": "if you think about it ecologically",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "A7252E8086",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "20",
        "end": "20",
        "startOffset": 76,
        "endOffset": 97,
        "text": "prey and the predator",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "1A6CCEF478",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "21",
        "end": "21",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 162,
        "text": "If cancer cells outcompete the immune cells for shared nutrients in the tumor microenvironment, then the immune cells will physically not be able to do their job.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "81FF7349CF",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "22",
        "end": "22",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 93,
        "text": "This predator-prey-shared resource type model is something I’ve worked on in my own research.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "E5D64B1CAF",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "23",
        "end": "23",
        "startOffset": 46,
        "endOffset": 77,
        "text": "restoring the metabolic balance",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "FA05697AAC",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "23",
        "end": "23",
        "startOffset": 120,
        "endOffset": 159,
        "text": "making sure immune cells get their food",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "D8F8B07F6B",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "23",
        "end": "23",
        "startOffset": 178,
        "endOffset": 191,
        "text": "the predators",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "438B170DF8",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "23",
        "end": "23",
        "startOffset": 221,
        "endOffset": 237,
        "text": "cancer, the prey",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "6DFFF7ECB0",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "24",
        "end": "24",
        "startOffset": 59,
        "endOffset": 88,
        "text": "cancer itself as an ecosystem",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "00A47CC3A7",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "24",
        "end": "24",
        "startOffset": 192,
        "endOffset": 225,
        "text": "predators -- the immune system --",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "AF8C173890",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "24",
        "end": "24",
        "startOffset": 266,
        "endOffset": 293,
        "text": "ecosystem of the human body",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "F13DA7695E",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "25",
        "end": "25",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 68,
        "text": "And what do we know about most ecosystems from conservation biology?",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "05DC1F694B",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "26",
        "end": "26",
        "startOffset": 29,
        "endOffset": 47,
        "text": "extinguish species",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "1B69B43FE6",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "26",
        "end": "26",
        "startOffset": 86,
        "endOffset": 110,
        "text": "target their environment",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "4C8DFD4A27",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "27",
        "end": "27",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 336,
        "text": "And so, once we have identified the key components of the tumor environment, we can propose hypotheses and simulate scenarios and therapeutic interventions all in a completely safe and affordable way and target different components of the microenvironment in such a way as to kill the cancer without harming the host, such as me or you.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "00BA11E3F6",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "28",
        "end": "28",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 154,
        "text": "And so while the immediate goal of my research is to advance research and innovation and to reduce its cost, the real intent, of course, is to save lives.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "A33075EF76",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "29",
        "end": "29",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 125,
        "text": "And that’s what I try to do through mathematical modeling applied to biology, and in particular, to the development of drugs.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "A96E6F349C",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "30",
        "end": "30",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 95,
        "text": "It's a field that until relatively recently has remained somewhat marginal, but it has matured.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "5BB08F63EC",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "31",
        "end": "31",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 180,
        "text": "And there are now very well-developed mathematical methods, a lot of preprogrammed tools, including free ones, and an ever-increasing amount of computational power available to us.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "DE53DDAAF4",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "32",
        "end": "32",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 45,
        "text": "The power and beauty of mathematical modeling",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "203C53306B",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "32",
        "end": "32",
        "startOffset": 68,
        "endOffset": 90,
        "text": "it makes you formalize",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "C5EF2C2753",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "33",
        "end": "33",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 163,
        "text": "We make assumptions, translate them into equations, run simulations, all to answer the question: In a world where my assumptions are true, what do I expect to see?",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "2370683AC1",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "34",
        "end": "34",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 42,
        "text": "It's a pretty simple conceptual framework.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "A97F965346",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "35",
        "end": "35",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 42,
        "text": "It's all about asking the right questions.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "02AC69B310",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "36",
        "end": "36",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 76,
        "text": "But it can unleash numerous opportunities for testing biological hypotheses.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "4AD9B03BC4",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "37",
        "end": "37",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 150,
        "text": "If our predictions match our observations, great! -- we got it right, so we can make further predictions by changing this or that aspect of the model.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "6A9AE842CC",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "38",
        "end": "38",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 200,
        "text": "If, however, our predictions do not match our observations, that means that some of our assumptions are wrong, and so our understanding of the key mechanisms of underlying biology is still incomplete.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "FA21E21217",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "39",
        "end": "39",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 63,
        "text": "Luckily, since this is a model, we control all the assumptions.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "B3CAC6B2BC",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "40",
        "end": "40",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 97,
        "text": "So we can go through them, one by one, identifying which one or ones are causing the discrepancy.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "413E56F5FE",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "41",
        "end": "41",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 111,
        "text": "And then we can fill this newly identified gap in knowledge using both experimental and theoretical approaches.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "FA02CAC620",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "42",
        "end": "42",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 149,
        "text": "Of course, any ecosystem is extremely complex, and trying to describe all the moving parts is not only very difficult, but also not very informative.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "EA69893FD5",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "43",
        "end": "43",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 137,
        "text": "There's also the issue of timescales, because some processes take place on a scale of seconds, some minutes, some days, months and years.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "64A2841FA7",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "44",
        "end": "44",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 67,
        "text": "It may not always be possible to separate those out experimentally.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "2996E55A17",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "45",
        "end": "45",
        "startOffset": 23,
        "endOffset": 46,
        "text": "so quickly or so slowly",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "CB91D06DEE",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "45",
        "end": "45",
        "startOffset": 52,
        "endOffset": 55,
        "text": "you",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "CFB54100FE",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "46",
        "end": "46",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 157,
        "text": "But as mathematicians, we have the power to zoom in on any subsystem in any timescale and simulate effects of interventions that take place in any timescale.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "D3C72CFC32",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "47",
        "end": "47",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 50,
        "text": "Of course, this isn't the work of a modeler alone.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "9B3BB017CC",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "48",
        "end": "48",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 56,
        "text": "It has to happen in close collaboration with biologists.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "97E7436571",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "49",
        "end": "49",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 62,
        "text": "And it does demand some capacity of translation on both sides.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "084C954865",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "50",
        "end": "50",
        "startOffset": 96,
        "endOffset": 169,
        "text": "testing hypotheses and simulating scenarios and therapeutic interventions",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "REP"
        ]
      },
      "id": "82FF9BABE5",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "51",
        "end": "51",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 153,
        "text": "It can identify gaps in knowledge and logical inconsistencies and can help guide us as to where we should keep looking and where there may be a dead end.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "43A0083E7E",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "52",
        "end": "52",
        "startOffset": 198,
        "endOffset": 230,
        "text": "propelling personalized medicine",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "AD4B776631",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "52",
        "end": "52",
        "startOffset": 72,
        "endOffset": 103,
        "text": "directly affect people's health",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "20C431E42D",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "53",
        "end": "53",
        "startOffset": 51,
        "endOffset": 104,
        "text": "and translating it to the right equation ... and back",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "REP"
        ]
      },
      "id": "96E0D740C4",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "54",
        "end": "54",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 10,
        "text": "Thank you.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "819FB1D376",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "55",
        "end": "55",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 10,
        "text": "(Applause)",
